24
00:02:13,530 --> 00:02:17,060
Well,I'm going to use Ugly Naked Guy's bathroom.
沒想到會有這一天 我要去用丑裸男的衛生間了

25
00:02:21,970 --> 00:02:23,870
Look! There's Monica and Chandler.
你看，是摩妮卡和錢德

26
00:02:25,540 --> 00:02:27,300
Hey,you guys! Hey.
