Come here! What?
喬伊，快過來 怎樣？

54
00:03:46,090 --> 00:03:48,250
Phoebe found out about Monica and Chandler.
菲比發現摩妮卡和錢德的事了

55
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:51,020
You mean how they're friends and nothing more?
就是他們是朋友，如此而已？

56
