Joey, she knows.
不，喬伊，她知道了

57
00:03:55,030 --> 00:03:58,120
We saw them doing it through the window.
我們剛才在丑裸男的公寓 看到他們隔著窗戶在做

58
00:03:58,970 --> 00:04:02,270
Actually,we saw them doing it up against the window.
應該說是靠著窗戶在做

59
00:04:04,010 --> 00:04:06,060
We saw them fornicating.
