I would enjoy that.
我喜歡

68
00:04:38,140 --> 00:04:41,230
You know what would be even more fun? Telling them.
你知道怎樣更好玩？ 告訴他們

69
00:04:42,410 --> 00:04:45,280
-That doesn't sound like fun. -So we'll make it fun.
聽起來不好玩 那就讓它變好玩

70
00:04:45,450 --> 00:04:48,470
We'll do it like a barbershop quartet!
我們可以學理髮店四重唱

71
