No,I want to do Phoebe's thing.
不，我想照菲比的做法

73
00:04:56,590 --> 00:04:57,580
I can't take
我沒辦法再… 

74
00:04:57,760 --> 00:05:01,350
You don't have to do anything. Just don't tell them we know.
你只要別說我們知道就行了

75
00:05:01,460 --> 00:05:03,330
No. I can't take anymore secrets.
不要，我沒辦法再保密了

76
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:06,760
I got your secrets,their secrets, secrets of my own.
我有你們的秘密，他們的秘密 還有我自己的秘密

77
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:10,430
You don't have any secrets.
你才沒有秘密

78
00:05:11,610 --> 00:05:15,240
Well, you don't know about Hugsy, my bedtime penguin pal.
是嗎？你就不知道 我有個企鵝抱枕叫抱寶

80
00:05:21,620 --> 00:05:24,080
How are we going to mess with them?
所以…我們要怎麼耍他們？

81
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:27,010
You could use your position as the roommate.
你可以利用室友的身份

82
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:30,850
And I would use the strongest tool at my disposal.
我就運用我最大的本錢 

83
