你還好嗎？

92
00:06:05,330 --> 00:06:07,490
If you really want to know
如果你真的想知道  

93
00:06:07,730 --> 00:06:09,250
I can't tell you this.
我不能告訴你

94
00:06:10,230 --> 00:06:11,960
You can tell me anything.
菲比，你什麼都可以告訴我

95
00:06:12,170 --> 00:06:15,330
Actually,you are the one person I can't tell this to.
事實上我就是不能告訴你 

96
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:18,160
And the one person I want to the most.
但我又最想告訴你

97
00:06:20,940 --> 00:06:22,070
What's going on?
怎麼了？

98
00:06:23,340 --> 00:06:26,510
I just haven't been with a guy in so long...
因為我很久沒跟男人在一起了

99
00:06:26,810 --> 00:06:29,340
...and sometimes you're looking for something...
有時你一直尋尋覓覓 

100
00:06:29,620 --> 00:06:33,280
...and it's right there in front of you,sipping coffee....
卻沒發現他就在你眼前喝咖啡

101
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:35,820
Oh,no. Have I said too much?
我說太多了嗎？

102
00:06:38,330 --> 00:06:41,490
Just something to think about. I know I will.
總之你考慮一下，我就會考慮

103
00:06:54,780 --> 00:06:56,440
You are so cute.
你好可愛 

104
00:06:57,010 --> 00:06:59,340
How did you get to be so cute?
你怎麼會這麼可愛？

105
00:06:59,610 --> 00:07:01,840
My grandfather was Swedish.
我爺爺是瑞典人 

106
00:07:02,050 --> 00:07:04,680
And my grandmother was a tiny little bunny.
我奶奶其實是只拇指兔

107
00:07:06,490 --> 00:07:08,720
Now you're even cuter.
你變得更可愛了

108
00:07:09,860 --> 00:07:14,120
-You know,that is a popular opinion today,I must say. -What?
這簡直是今天的民意 什麼？

109
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:16,990
The weirdest thing happened at the coffeehouse.
今天在咖啡館有一件怪事 

110
00:07:17,230 --> 00:07:18,790
I think Phoebe was hitting on me.
我覺得菲比在釣我

111
00:07:20,070 --> 00:07:21,730
