I'm sorry,Phoebe's just always thought you were charming...
抱歉，只是在菲比眼中 

115
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:38,980
...in a sexless kind of way.
你的迷人是無性的

116
00:07:39,250 --> 00:07:42,090
You know,I can't hear that enough.
這種話真是百聽不厭

117
00:07:43,420 --> 00:07:45,650
I'm sorry, I just think you misunderstood her.
抱歉，你應該誤解她的意思了

118
00:07:45,890 --> 00:07:48,490
No, I didn't,okay? She was all over me.
我沒有誤解，好嗎？ 她只差沒撲上來

119
00:07:48,760 --> 00:07:51,030
She touched my bicep, for crying out loud.
她還摸我的二頭肌尖叫

120
00:07:51,730 --> 00:07:52,720
This bicep?
這個二頭肌？

121
00:07:53,230 --> 00:07:55,900
Well,it's not flexed right now.
是我現在沒擠它

122
00:07:59,740 --> 00:08:02,710
Why is it so hard for you to believe that Phoebe could be attracted to me?
為什麼你這麼難相信 菲比對我有意思？

123
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:04,440
