我沒有啊 

124
00:08:04,610 --> 00:08:07,450
All the girls are attracted to you.
女生都會對你有意思

125
00:08:07,620 --> 00:08:09,810
You're part bunny.
你有拇指兔的血統

126
00:08:14,860 --> 00:08:17,380
Mon, What are you doing now? you want to come see a movie with us?
摩妮卡，你要幹什麼？ 要不要一起去看電影？

127
00:08:18,630 --> 00:08:21,460
Actually,I was going to do some laundry.
事實上我正要去洗衣服

128
00:08:24,170 --> 00:08:25,530
Want to do it with me?
錢德，要不要一起去？ 

129
00:08:25,730 --> 00:08:27,720
Sure,I'll do it with you.
好啊，我跟你一起去

