我這裡有

135
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:52,920
Great. Now we can do laundry all night. All night laundry!
太好了 我們可以洗一整晚的衣服了

136
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:58,190
Hey,any word on the apartment yet?
羅斯，公寓申請得怎樣？

137
00:08:58,430 --> 00:09:01,990
I called there,and it turns out Naked Guy is subletting it.
我打過去問 原來丑裸男要自己轉租

138
00:09:02,270 --> 00:09:04,070
He's already had 100 applicants.
而且已經有一大堆申請者

139
00:09:04,270 --> 00:09:06,210
-Oh,man. -No,no,it's okay.
沒關係

140
00:09:06,370 --> 00:09:09,940
Because you know what the difference between them and me is?
我跟他們的差別是…

141
00:09:10,110 --> 00:09:12,170
Your history of bedwetting?
你有尿床的歷史？

142
00:09:12,950 --> 00:09:15,380
Hey,I trusted you,man!
你怎麼可以說出來

143
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:19,140
Anyway,the difference is...
總之差別是...

144
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,690
