我佔了優勢

145
00:09:20,890 --> 00:09:23,580
It's not exactly ethical, but I sent him a bribe...
我知道這樣有點奸詐 但我送了點東西...

146
00:09:23,890 --> 00:09:26,380
...to tip the scales in my direction.
...去賄賂他

147
00:09:26,660 --> 00:09:28,190
You can see it from the window.
從窗戶搞不好看得到

148
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:34,660
-Is it that pinball machine with the big bow on it? -No.
是那個打了蝴蝶結的彈珠檯嗎 不是

149
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:38,400
-That new mountain bike? -No.
那輛新的登山車？ 不是

150
00:09:41,580 --> 00:09:42,840
What did you send?
那你送什麼？ 

151
00:09:43,110 --> 00:09:45,870
A basket of mini muffins.
一籃小英式鬆餅

152
