There's a whole table of them. Which one did you send?
但桌上全都是小英式鬆餅 哪一籃是你送的？

153
00:09:51,550 --> 00:09:53,610
The small one.
小的那一籃

154
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:59,220
You actually thought that basket was going to get you the apartment?
什麼？你真以為那籃鬆餅 能幫你爭取到公寓？

155
00:09:59,460 --> 00:10:04,190
Someone sent us a basket at work, and people went crazy over those muffins.
對，我們辦公室曾經收到一籃 大家都愛得不得了

156
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:06,030
It was the best day.
那天真的很高興

157
00:10:06,270 --> 00:10:08,460
Your work makes me sad.
你的工作讓我覺得好悲慘

158
00:10:09,970 --> 00:10:13,030
Oh, man, I want that place so much!
真是的，我好想要那層公寓

159
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:15,940
