00:10:25,250 --> 00:10:28,090
Bye, Chandler. I miss you already.
錢德再見，我已經開始想你了

164
00:10:33,290 --> 00:10:36,130
Did you see that? The inappropriate, and the pinching?
你看到她嗲哩嗲氣還捏我嗎？

165
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:37,490
Actually,I did.
我看到了

166
00:10:37,730 --> 00:10:40,220
So do you believe that she's attracted to me?
你相信她對我有意思了吧？

167
00:10:42,270 --> 00:10:45,260
Oh,my God! She knows about us!
天哪，她知道我們的事了？

168
00:10:45,470 --> 00:10:46,460
Are you serious?
真的還假的？ 

169
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:49,010
She knows,and she's trying to freak us out!
菲比知道了，她想嚇我們

170
00:10:49,610 --> 00:10:51,600
