這是唯一的解釋

171
00:10:54,980 --> 00:10:59,250
But what about my pinchable butt and my bulging biceps?
那我好捏的屁股 和激凸的二頭肌呢？

172
00:10:59,820 --> 00:11:00,950
She knows!
